      "be1845598369_html": "All bed options, including handwoven and hardwood, are handcrafted for quality and individuality. Each handwoven bed also includes a plush, soft pillow for added comfort.",
      "be945000166_html": "ETHICALLY HARVESTED WOOD",
      "be1875807302_html": "Sustainably sourced wood from ethically managed forests. Each wooden bed features its own unique color and grain.",
      "be1042956689_html": "STRENGTH &amp; STYLE",
      "be457743707_html": "Engineered for strength, the arm assembly withstands up to 176 lbs, while the Handwoven and Wood beds comfortably support pets up to 45 lbs. Designed for feline use only, with matte black or white arms to complement your space.",
      "be1255351641_html": "SECURE &amp; STABLE",
      "be1424145618_html": "Equipped with non-slip silicone pads for surface protection and secure grip. Fits securely on surfaces up to 2.75 inches thick.",
      "be127538641434_html": "<b>FOR CATS &amp; THEIR HUMANS</b>",
      "be1149693046_html": "Become a Purrch Insider.",
      "be702874065_html": "Get early access to new releases and updates.",
      "be1466350579_html": "Subscribe failed",
      "be406277700_html": "Thanks for subscribe",
      "be1566729641_html": "HANDCRAFTED &amp; SUSTAINABLY MADE",
      "be299184911_html": "Each wood bed is meticulously handcrafted from sustainably sourced materials, ensuring that every piece features a unique grain and color. No two beds are alike, making each one truly special.",
      "be602897937_html": "Precision. Stability. Versatility.",
      "be652732414_html": "STRENGTH MEETS STYLE",
      "be263095857_html": "Our patent-pending design is built for seamless adjustability and rock-solid support. Available in black and white, our arms elevate any space with a sleek, modern aesthetic. Pressure-tested up to 176 lbs, they offer unmatched durability while complementing your setup effortlessly.",
      "be312294448_html": "SPECIFICATIONS",
      "be381990598_html": "Desk-Mounted Arm Assembly",
      "be1028105088_html": "3 kg (6.6 lb)",
      "be168450348_html": "Handwoven Bed with Pillow",
