      "be415593310_html": "Handcrafted Wood Bed",
      "be1980397881_html": "42 * 41 * 10 cm / 3 kg (6.6 lb)",
      "be140167767647_html": "<i>Minor variances as beds are handcrafted.</i>",
      "be1652856197_html": "FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ)",
      "be2111668732_html": " Will the ERGO PURRCH® hold a large or heavy cat?",
      "be589799823_html": " Does the ERGO PURRCH® fit a standing desk?",
      "be172414154_html": "Is ERGO PURRCH® a good option for small apartments?",
      "be2121549284_html": "Where can ERGO PURRCH® be installed?",
      "be383800726_html": "Does ERGO PURRCH® stay stable during everyday use?",
      "be2070213862_html": "Which model is best for my cat?",
      "be1106150414_html": "Do you ship internationally?",
      "be837333939_html": "Yes. The ERGO PURRCH® beds are rated to support cats up to 45 lbs, backed by an arm assembly pressure-tested to 176 lbs — the highest documented weight capacity of any premium, handcrafted desk-mounted cat bed on the market. Suitable for large breeds including Maine Coons, Ragdolls, Norwegian Forest Cats, and Bengals. Featured cat models in our photos weigh between 14 and 22 lbs — often both in the bed at the same time.",
      "be733788932_html": "Yes. ERGO PURRCH® clamps securely onto virtually any desk or flat surface up to 2.75 inches (7 cm) thick — if it has an edge, we mount to it. Standing desks, gaming desks, sit-stand desks, office desks, kitchen counters, shelves, nightstands, and more. Confirmed compatible with popular setups including the SecretLab Magnus, UPLIFT, FlexiSpot, and most IKEA desks — and that's just a handful of examples. If it has a surface edge, ERGO PURRCH® attaches to it. The non-slip silicone pads protect your surface, and the set screw locks the arm securely in place — an Allen-key is included.",
      "be444978984_html": "Yes. Because ERGO PURRCH® mounts to the edge of a surface, it adds an elevated resting spot without taking up floor or surface space, making it well suited for small apartments and compact homes.",
      "be888831548_html": "ERGO PURRCH® can be installed on many flat surfaces such as desks, tables, countertops, and sturdy window sills up to 2.75 inches thick, offering flexible placement throughout the home.",
      "be1712855956_html": "Yes. ERGO PURRCH® is designed with a secure clamp system and stable arm construction to provide a safe, reliable resting place when installed properly. The clamp features non-slip silicone pads on both sides to protect your surface and prevent any movement. A set screw locks the arm into your preferred position — an Allen wrench is included for easy tightening. No drilling, no adhesives, no desk modification required.",
      "be1354564160_html": "Both models are designed to support up to 45 lbs, making them suitable for larger cats. The wooden model offers a more spacious surface area, which may be preferred for multiple cats or those who like extra room. The handwoven model provides a different aesthetic while still accommodating larger breeds comfortably.",
      "be962339791_html": "We proudly offer international shipping, with fees varying based on your location. If you don't see your country listed, feel free to reach out—we're happy to explore adding new markets to our store.",
      "be663652197_html": "Have more questions? Visit our full FAQ →",
